Internal services often rely on network trust.This is legacy architecture thinking.
Firewall protects internal service from internet. But SSRF bypassed firewall. Because request came from inside.

🛡️ Defense
	1. Internal services must authenticate.
	2. mTLS between services.
	3. Zero-trust networking.
	4. Never expose privileged endpoints over plain HTTP internally.

